==
\n

I am an ML research scientist and engineer working on online learning, anomaly detection, agent memory and orchestration, and learning problems in stochastic networks. My work includes theoretical research and deployed machine-learning systems, including [https://docs.aws.amazon.com/guardduty/latest/ug/rds-protection.html GuardDuty for RDS Protection] and capabilities in Amazon Quick and the SageMaker assistant. \n

*Background* \n

From 2020 to 2026, I worked at Amazon Web Services. Before that, I was a postdoctoral researcher at the University of California, Berkeley, hosted by Venkat Anantharam. I received my PhD from The University of Texas at Austin, where I was advised by François Baccelli. I completed my B.Tech. and M.Tech. at IIT Madras.

